        "data": {
          "name": "multiline_label_experience_is_added_to_your_rest",
          "text": "Critics are not predictable. Once I am eligible, each opening has a 30% chance of bringing one to my restaurant. Only a perfectly served order earns the next level and restaurant star. If I fail, another Critic may visit on a later day. My reputation cannot fall below a star milestone I have already earned. At least one bad meal cannot erase my entire career.",
